# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# No Content-Security-Policy yet. A CSP would immediately break the four Stitch
# pages, which load the Tailwind Play CDN (cdn.tailwindcss.com) and hotlink six
# images from lh3.googleusercontent.com. The CSP ships with the Astro rebuild,
# once both are gone.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
